<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merck Q3, 96 EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merck Q3, 96 EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it cut its share earnings estimates on Merck and Co Inc to $0.82 from $0.85 for the third quarter and to $3.19 from $3.24 for 1996.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Our estimate reductions are the result of recent guidance from Merck, which has caused us to lower our estimate of Merck's gross margins going forward,&quot; NatWest said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1/2 to 70-3/4.</p>
</text>
